          <div class="hierarchy-card group-c">
            <h4>Levels 1 to 5 (Operational & Technical Support)</h4>
            <div class="badge-tag">Former Group 'C' Cadre</div>
            <p><strong>Covered Posts:</strong> Multi-Tasking Staff (MTS), Lower Division Clerks (LDC), Upper Division Clerks (UDC), Skilled Artisans, Constables, and Head Constables.</p>
            <p><strong>Historical Grade Pay:</strong> GP ₹1,800, GP ₹1,900, GP ₹2,000, GP ₹2,400, and GP ₹2,800.</p>
            <span class="card-footer-note">Forms the operational base of field offices and railway operations.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="hierarchy-card group-b">
            <h4>Levels 6 to 9 (Executive & Supervisory Cadre)</h4>
            <div class="badge-tag">Former Group 'B' Non-Gazetted & Gazetted</div>
            <p><strong>Covered Posts:</strong> Section Officers, Inspectors of Central GST/Customs, Sub-Inspectors (CPOs), Nursing Officers, and Senior Section Engineers.</p>
            <p><strong>Historical Grade Pay:</strong> GP ₹4,200, GP ₹4,600, GP ₹4,800, and GP ₹5,400 (PB-2).</p>
            <span class="card-footer-note">Represents frontline administrative leadership and technical supervision.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="hierarchy-card group-a">
            <h4>Levels 10 to 12 (Junior & Senior Administrative Grades)</h4>
            <div class="badge-tag">Group 'A' Entry & Management</div>
            <p><strong>Covered Posts:</strong> Direct recruit civil servants (IAS, IPS, IRS, IFS via UPSC), Executive Engineers, Deputy Secretaries, and Superintendents of Police.</p>
            <p><strong>Historical Grade Pay:</strong> GP ₹5,400 (PB-3), GP ₹6,600, and GP ₹7,600.</p>
            <span class="card-footer-note">Entry level for direct recruit officers and administrative management.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="hierarchy-card group-apex">
            <h4>Levels 13 to 18 (Senior Management & Apex Executive)</h4>
            <div class="badge-tag">Senior Administrative to Apex</div>
            <p><strong>Covered Posts:</strong> Directors, Joint Secretaries, Additional Secretaries, Special Secretaries, Secretaries to GoI, and the Cabinet Secretary (Level 18).</p>
            <p><strong>Historical Grade Pay:</strong> GP ₹8,700, GP ₹10,000, HAG, HAG+, Apex Scale, and Cabinet Secretary Scale.</p>
            <span class="card-footer-note">Formulates national policy and directs government departments.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
